A||||8||87GT||My First Fiero
Z||000000||87GT||05-20-99||09:56 PM||||Hello, I am new to this site, just wanted to stop in and say hello.  I just purchased a 87 Fiero GT in April from its original owner.  The car is maroon with a grey lower bottom.  The car has 84,000 miles on it with no rebuilds or anything. It is all stock with a 5-Sp transmission.  I have put a Hypertech Performance chip in it and it made quite a bid of difference.  So far, I really love my little micro machine!  I get compliments all the time with it.  The whole reason I wanted a fiero to begin with was because I saw a fiero club meet in Daytona last year and ever since, I had to get my hands on one! 8-)  I finally succeeded in that.  Anyways, that is enough for now.  I will be around now, since I found this chat. see ya all later. 
Z||000001||Carrolles||05-21-99||06:53 AM||||Welcome abord!<p>Carroll
Z||000002||ChadMan||05-21-99||07:46 AM||||Now you've gone and done it!  Once you've owned a Fiero, you're hooked...your first Fiero probably won't be your last.<p>Hope you've decided to join FOCOA and your local chapter.  You'll meet some great people and learn a lot more about Fieros.
Z||000003||theogre||05-22-99||05:55 PM||||tell me about it....... I'm getting a really nice 84 in the next week or 2.
Z||000004||Gokart||05-23-99||05:29 PM||||Hey 87 GT. Never let'er go! I recently got one myself. Back in 92 I had an 85 coupe and loved her. Gave her up for my fiancee, now wife cause we needed a "family" ride with kids on the way. I pretended it didn't bother me because I do love her, but it broke my heart to let'er go. Well a month ago I got Fiero fever again (never really lost it!) and made up my mind I WANTED A GT! Only took 2 weeks to find the right one, and we'll NEVER part! I love my wife, but isn't funny the things we do for chicks! <p><br>
Z||000005||87GT||05-23-99||09:07 PM||||Yeah, I think we will do anything for women!  The thing that makes my car so special is that it is the only one in all of Pasco county, here in Florida that was cared for.  I knew the original owner well.  He told me that I was the only person he would sell it to.  I have had some people say, "When did Pontiac come out with that?"  I say, "This fastback model came out in 86' and was axed in 88'."  They think its a new car! LOL!  I washed my car today and after I was done, I just had to take it out for a drive. 8-)
Z||000006||spike||05-28-99||07:21 AM||||I too am a big Fiero GT lover. As far as I am concerned the fiero looks perfect. I love the body lines. I get excited just by looking at one. I have owned a 86 4cyl. and a 87 GT. Off course I loved the GT more, then again who wouldn't thanks to that little v6 in the back. I started having problems with my Fiero GT and decided to sell it and get more power. My choice was a 87 Stang GT, also a very nice car. It was lowered and was yellow with black racing stripes. Just last summer I decided to sell it due to many problems and after 2 years I was tired of it. I found a guy who was willing to trade my Stang for an 87 GT with a T-Top. I was not to sure if I should. I asked a couple and they told me that my Stang was worth more and that I would have to be crazy to trade. Well I wish I was crazy and traded. The following summer everything broke on my mustang. I invested 4,000.00 into it and sold it for 4400.00. In total with what I paid for the car I lost big-time. I am kicking myself in the head every day for not trading. Not only did the Fiero GT have a T-Top but also had 3 star mags and the body was in good shape as well as mechanics. I have always done what I want and the next time I will do just that. I WILL HAVE ANOTHER FIERO SOON AND I INTEND ON KEEPING IT FOR A LONG TIME. Ouch! That time was a little hard. Please feal free to kick me in the head as well. It might help. Thanks.
Z||000007||Gokart||05-29-99||08:25 PM||||Spike, you want a GT again bad enough you'll find it! Get every Auto trader, newspaper, peenysaver you can get your hands on. Word of mouth helps too. I made up my mind a week before I found mine I would even follow a GT and make an offer to the owner if I had to!! GOOD LUCK!
Z||000008||87GT||05-31-99||02:21 PM||||Hey, you can even see some GT's for auction on ebay.  I see some every now and then.  Some better than others.
